    "notes": [
      "50 exact-release hostapd Makefiles rehashed; wpa-cli package/build contract verified. Package availability is not proof it is installed on a device.",
      "Native bss_info and iface.ctrl(\"STATUS\") verified from exact official 24.10.0 through 24.10.8 and 25.12.0 through 25.12.6 sources. Older method support is not assumed; capability fallback selects the actual available path.",
      "The same evidence rules are exercised across 50 release contracts, including old wlan0-1 and newer phy7-sta0 interface shapes. Responses are synthetic, not device captures.",
      "No CPU, hardware model, driver index, radio number or firmware version is used to guess connection success. Driver association is never the authentication substitute.",
      "Actual router runtime validation remains pending. No claim of all-device, all-firmware or derivative-firmware certification."
    ]
